MSG(CliHelp, L"Scroll Rescue 0.3.0\r\n\r\n使用方法：\r\n  scroll-rescue-cli devices [--json] [--lang <auto|zh-CN|en>]\r\n  scroll-rescue-cli repair [--device <ID> | --all] [--dry-run] [--no-elevate]\r\n\r\n--lang 可放在命令前后，仅对本次运行生效。\r\n只有一个设备时自动选择；多个设备时必须指定。\r\n--device 可重复使用。--dry-run 只预览，不重启设备。", L"Scroll Rescue 0.3.0\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  scroll-rescue-cli devices [--json] [--lang <auto|zh-CN|en>]\r\n  scroll-rescue-cli repair [--device <ID> | --all] [--dry-run] [--no-elevate]\r\n\r\n--lang may appear before or after the command; it applies to this run only.\r\nA single device is selected automatically; select explicitly when there are several.\r\n--device may be repeated. --dry-run previews without restarting devices.")
